            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sugarplum"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My husband and son both really liked this. We agreed that it didn't taste like any chicken a la king that we have ever had before but it still tasted very good. I think it was the spinach that made it taste different. We had some left overs that tasted even better the next day.",
